WEBVTT

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.704
which then drip off into this bowl.

00:09:31.728 --> 00:09:33.212
(Laughter)

00:09:33.236 --> 00:09:37.379
And then, just to complete
this wonderful picture,

00:09:37.403 --> 00:09:39.990
I also provide my participants with a bib,

00:09:40.014 --> 00:09:43.117
available in either pink
or blue, as they please.

00:09:43.141 --> 00:09:47.228
(Laughter)

00:09:47.252 --> 00:09:49.366
Looks like a normal
eating experience, right?

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:50.540
(Laughter)

00:09:51.585 --> 00:09:53.005
No, obviously not.

00:09:54.546 --> 00:09:55.895
And worse,

00:09:55.919 --> 00:09:59.260
I can't even control
what my participants are thinking about,

00:09:59.284 --> 00:10:01.395
so I need to repeat this taste procedure